+# RS-1 тАФ Runtime Supervisor / Composition Root (hot-zone implementation plan)
+
+**Date:** 2026-05-30
+**Crate / branch:** `rust/prro` on `rust-gateway`
+**Worklet:** RS-1 тАФ first build unit of the runtime spine
+**Blueprint:** `docs/architecture/2026-05-30-runtime-spine-connection-blueprint.md` ┬з3 (RS-1)
