+## 9. What RS-1 explicitly does NOT do (boundary)
+
+- **No ingress.** No HTTP/Maria/XML-RPC listener is bound. The `listeners` config (`config/mod.rs:29`)
+  is **not** consumed by RS-1. That is **RS-2**.
